249,"end":250,"surface":"琨","kind":"person","person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line016:m0251","start":251,"end":254,"surface":"段匹磾","kind":"person","person_id":"1y3_yi0_8d4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line016:m0257","start":257,"end":258,"surface":"嶠","kind":"person","person_id":"6v8_pk9_7k5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao:line016:m0259","start":259,"end":260,"surface":"琨","kind":"person","person_id":"b21_e55_8bd","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":16,"last_line":16,"revision_id":2592755},"source_quote":{"witness":"j67","quote":"屬二都傾覆，社稷絕祀，元帝初鎮江左，琨誠繫王室，謂嶠曰：「昔班彪識劉氏之復興，馬援知漢光之可輔。今晉祚雖衰，天命未改，吾欲立功河朔，使卿延譽江南，子其行乎？」對曰：「嶠雖無管張之才，而明公有桓文之志，欲建匡合之功，豈敢辭命。」乃以為左長史，檄告華夷，奉表勸進。嶠既至，引見，具陳琨忠誠，志在效節，因說社稷無主，天人係望，辭旨慷慨。舉朝屬目，帝器而嘉焉。王導、周顗、謝鯤、庾亮、桓彝等並與親善。于時江左草創，綱維未舉，嶠殊以為憂。及見王導共談，歡然曰；「江左自有管夷吾，吾復何慮！」屢求反命，不許。會琨為段匹磾所害，嶠表琨忠誠，雖勳業不遂，然家破身亡，宜在褒崇，以慰海內之望。帝然之。","raw_start":463,"raw_end":754,"raw_line":16},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao","book_id":"b-jinshu-067","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-067-wenqiao"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line019","text":"昔漢祖以神武革命，開建帝業，繼以文帝之賢，纂承洪緒，清虛玄默，擬跡成康。賈誼歎息，以為天下倒懸，雖言有抑揚，不失事體。今聖朝肇建，漸振宏綱，往段匹磾遣使求效忠節，尚未有勞，便以方州與之。今靳明等為國雪恥，欲除大逆，此之志望，皆欲附翼天飛。雖功大宜報，亦宜有以裁之，當杜漸防萌，慎之在始。中間不逞，互生事變，皆非忠義，率以一朝之榮。天下漸弊，實由於此。春秋之時，天子微弱，諸侯奢侈，晉文思崇周室，至有求隧之請，襄王讓之以禮，聞義而服，自爾諸侯莫敢越度。臣謂前者賊寇未殄，苟以濟事，朝廷諸所加授，頗多爵位兼重。今自臣以下，宜皆除之，且以塞群小矜功之望，夷狄無懨之求。若復遷延，顧望流俗，使奸狡生心，遂相怨謗，指摘朝廷，讒諛蜂起，臣有以知陛下無以正之。此安危之機，天下之望。","annotation_status":"reviewed","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line019:m0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"漢祖","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line019:m0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_AC","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line019:m0033","start":33,"end":34,"surface":"成","kind":"person","person_id":"qna_m75_pj8","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"讀本段前後及對話，所指按此處記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line019:m0034","start":34,"end":35,"surface":"康","kind":"person","person_id":"nek_dsn_nih","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"讀本段前後及對話，所指按此處記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line019:m0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"賈誼","kind":"person","person_id":"y6v_c03_at3","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line019:m0071","start":71,"end":74,"surface":"段匹磾","kind":"person","person_id":"1y3_yi0_8d4","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line019:m0094","start":94,"end":96,"surface":"靳明","kind":"person","person_id":"q6b_1jc_pqc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line019:m0190","start":190,"end":192,"surface":"晉文","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji:line019:m0204","start":204,"end":206,"surface":"襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"gt1_z7d_s3u","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":19,"last_line":19,"revision_id":2614273},"source_quote":{"witness":"j98","quote":"昔漢祖以神武革命，開建帝業，繼以文帝之賢，纂承洪緒，清虛玄默，擬跡成康。賈誼歎息，以為天下倒懸，雖言有抑揚，不失事體。今聖朝肇建，漸振宏綱，往段匹磾遣使求效忠節，尚未有勞，便以方州與之。今靳明等為國雪恥，欲除大逆，此之志望，皆欲附翼天飛。雖功大宜報，亦宜有以裁之，當杜漸防萌，慎之在始。中間不逞，互生事變，皆非忠義，率以一朝之榮。天下漸弊，實由於此。春秋之時，天子微弱，諸侯奢侈，晉文思崇周室，至有求隧之請，襄王讓之以禮，聞義而服，自爾諸侯莫敢越度。臣謂前者賊寇未殄，苟以濟事，朝廷諸所加授，頗多爵位兼重。今自臣以下，宜皆除之，且以塞群小矜功之望，夷狄無懨之求。若復遷延，顧望流俗，使奸狡生心，遂相怨謗，指摘朝廷，讒諛蜂起，臣有以知陛下無以正之。此安危之機，天下之望。","raw_start":1228,"raw_end":1562,"raw_line":19},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji","book_id":"b-jinshu-098","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-098-jin033-wangji"}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luchen","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-luchen","source":{"title":"晉書卷四十四","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1775345","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=1775345","revision_id":1775345,"accessed_on":"2026-11-21","extent":"固定數位題「志子諶」題下全文。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代本文及維基文庫數位轉錄。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"維基文庫固定修訂1775345","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-1775345-raw.wikitext","wikitext_sha256":"09742e651b479fea881fd24c7734451de2b78b9f0410adda36ba210c31a0b5c8","raw_file_sha256":"09742e651b479fea881fd24c7734451de2b78b9f0410adda36ba210c31a0b5c8","collation_witnesses":["source-evidence/jin044-luchen-cuiyue/reading.json"]}},{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-067-wenqiao","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-067","source_id":"s-jinshu-067-wenqiao","source":{"title":"晉書卷六十七","provider":"Wikisource","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2592755","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2592755","revision_id":2592755,"accessed_on":"2026-11-21","extent":"固定數位原題「溫嶠」題下全文。","text_scope":"partial_chapter","review_status":"text_checked","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文及維基文庫數位轉錄；保留見證歸屬。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","edition":"維基文庫固定修訂2592755","raw_path":"sources/jinshu/wikisource-2592755-raw.wikitext","wikitext_sha256":"bfbb80734b71669aaed368f54f088c89285f1acdbe70ca678745ea9684029495","raw_file_sha256":"bfbb80734b71669aaed368f54f088c89285f1acdbe70ca678745ea9684029495","collation_witnesses":["source-evidence/jin067-wen-children/reading.json","source-evidence/jin067-wenqiao-main/reading.json"]}},{"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-098-j